---
import SheepMark from './SheepMark.astro';
---

<header class="masthead">
  <SheepMark class="masthead-sheep" />
  <h1 class="masthead-title">
    Do Agents Dream of
    <span class="word-electric"
      >Electric<svg
        class="bolt-line"
        viewBox="0 0 120 10"
        preserveAspectRatio="none"
        aria-hidden="true"
        ><path
          d="M0 8 L15 2 L30 8 L45 2 L60 8 L75 2 L90 8 L105 2 L120 8"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2.5"
        ></path></svg
      ></span
    > Sheep?
  </h1>
  <p class="masthead-sub">사람이 고르고 클로드가 엮는 AI 주간지</p>
</header>
